window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The prophecy declares the darkness that once brought the world to its knees will return. The timing is no coincidence and I can’t help but fear it all points back to me.</b></p> <p>With my heritage revealed, I finally know where I fit in. It’s not what I expected, but I can’t change it, just like I can’t change who I am drawn to.</p> <p>A shifter, a demon, a vampire, an angel.</p> <p>The stakes have been raised and souls have been sealed, but the questions keep stacking up. As the target on my back continues to grow, I am forced into the heart of a war I have no interest in fighting.</p> <p>One thing is certain: there are bigger games at play and I must find my place among the madness. But with my trust on unstable ground, will I carry on alone or lean on those breaking down my walls?</p> <p>The battle for survival has begun.</p>"; 
